Changes made in this distribution
---------------------------------
- Packaged for Autodesk Revit 2027 specifically, rather than the upstream
  multi-year (2022-2027) source tree.
- Added install.ps1, a simplified per-user deployment script that copies the
  addin and server into %APPDATA% and %LOCALAPPDATA% without requiring admin.
- Added README.md and docs/ written for this distribution, including client
  configuration for Claude, Codex and Cursor.
- No modifications to upstream source code. The redistributed binaries are
  unmodified build outputs.

